sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Tester makes Test System send a NotifyEventRequest message

    loop Steps 1 and 2 are repeated n times
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (periodic event)
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
        Note over CSMS: Validation: NotifyEventResponse with empty body
    end
